{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02853","headline":"秋晚登古城 · 李百药","name":"秋晚登古城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日落征途远，怅然临古城。\n颓墉寒雀集，荒堞晚乌惊。\n萧森灌木上，迢遰孤烟生。\n霞景焕余照，露气澄晚清。\n秋风转摇落，此志安可平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「秋晚登古城」条、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"杨 柳 柯继承"}